  "What's your favorite season? · 第三十一课：你最喜欢哪个季节？（梅想念北京的秋天）": "Today in class, Ms. Park asked, \"What's your favorite season?\" I said my favorite is autumn, or fall in America. The Beijing leaves were red and gold then. I looked out the window and saw the Berkeley trees starting to turn. Autumn here can be pretty too, and I only miss home a little.",
