  "What did you watch last night? · 第三十六课：你昨晚看了什么？（感恩节后的英语课）": "Today in class, Hyun-Woo asked me, \"What did you watch last night?\" I said, \"After dinner, we watched football. The American kind.\" I didn't understand it, so I just ate pie and clapped. Next year, I want to understand the game better.",
