  "Should I Go Home for Spring Festival? · 第五十五课：要不要回国过年？（梅的故事 · 第 11 章）": "Spring Festival is in two weeks. My parents want me home, but the ticket is eighteen hundred dollars! Going home is more expensive than my whole month's rent. I made a list, and I decided to stay this year to build my own life.",
