  "How was your weekend? · 第一课:周末怎么样?(梅告诉安娜自己转正了)": "My weekend was so good! My company told me I'm full-time now, so I have a real job. I just want to smile big because it's huge news! I'm so happy for me. I have something to celebrate this year.",
  "What do you usually do? · 第二课:你平时都做什么?(梅讲新作息)": "On weekdays, I usually open the store and help customers. I love recommending books to them! My boss lets me bring my own lunch and take a one-hour break. It feels like the store is partly mine.",
  "I'm still studying English. · 第三课:我还在学英语(梅升到中级班)": "Even with a full-time job, I am still studying English. I got moved to the intermediate class this year, which is harder, but I'm making progress. Every week I understand more. It feels good!",
  "They're going to visit me. · 第四课:他们要来看我了(梅父母计划来美国)": "I have big news! My parents are going to visit me in November for two weeks. I still can't believe it! Really, they are coming here! I miss them so much. My two worlds are coming together.",
  "One Year In: First Real Job · 第五课:满一年了——第一份正式工作（梅 Year 2 · 第 13 章）": "Today is August 30, and I have lived in California for exactly one year. I have a real job now, working full-time at the bookstore. I had never been in the owner's office before today. It’s amazing!",
