  "I like it because it's quiet. · 第八课:我喜欢这里,因为安静(梅在咖啡馆向安娜解释)": "I like Berkeley because it's quiet. To me, it's very different from my hometown. It's a college town, and there are students everywhere, but it still feels calm. I see this city differently.",
  "What does she look like? · 第九课:她长什么样?(梅给妈妈介绍即将见面的人)": "My mom is curious about my friends here. Anna is medium height with short hair and a kind smile. Linda is taller than me and has some gray hair. She is the calmest person I know. Mom wants to thank her in person.",
  "Driving to LA · 第十课:开车去洛杉矶(梅 Year 2 · 第 14 章)": "Last weekend I drove to LA for the first time. It started to rain hard while I was passing San Luis Obispo. Cars were slowing down. I was nervous but proud when I arrived.",
