  "I have worked there for one year. · 第十二课:我在那里工作一年了(梅带爸妈参观书店)": "On Saturday, I took my parents to the bookstore. Sarah at the front said I've worked here for one year, and I'm their best! My dad even found a book by an author he read in college. It felt good.",
